{
  "sn22.56:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 22.56 ",
  "sn22.56:0.2": "6. Upayavagga ",
  "sn22.56:0.3": "Upādānaparipavattasutta ",
  "sn22.56:1.1": "Sāvatthinidānaṁ. ",
  "sn22.56:1.2": "“Pañcime, bhikkhave, upādānakkhandhā. ",
  "sn22.56:1.3": "Katame pañca? ",
  "sn22.56:1.4": "Rūpupādānakkhandho, vedanupādānakkhandho, saññupādānakkhandho, saṅkhārupādānakkhandho, viññāṇupādānakkhandho. ",
  "sn22.56:1.5": "Yāvakīvañcāhaṁ, bhikkhave, ime pañcupādānakkhandhe catuparivaṭṭaṁ yathābhūtaṁ nābbhaññāsiṁ, neva tāvāhaṁ, bhikkhave, sadevake loke samārake sabrahmake sassamaṇabrāhmaṇiyā pajāya sadevamanussāya anuttaraṁ sammāsambodhiṁ abhisambuddhoti paccaññāsiṁ. ",
  "sn22.56:1.6": "Yato ca khvāhaṁ, bhikkhave, ime pañcupādānakkhandhe catuparivaṭṭaṁ yathābhūtaṁ abbhaññāsiṁ, athāhaṁ, bhikkhave, sadevake loke …pe… ",
  "sn22.56:1.7": "sadevamanussāya anuttaraṁ sammāsambodhiṁ abhisambuddhoti paccaññāsiṁ. ",
  "sn22.56:2.1": "Kathañca catuparivaṭṭaṁ? ",
  "sn22.56:2.2": "Rūpaṁ abbhaññāsiṁ, rūpasamudayaṁ abbhaññāsiṁ, rūpanirodhaṁ abbhaññāsiṁ, rūpanirodhagāminiṁ paṭipadaṁ abbhaññāsiṁ; ",
  "sn22.56:2.3": "vedanaṁ … ",
  "sn22.56:2.4": "saññaṁ … ",
  "sn22.56:2.5": "saṅkhāre … ",
  "sn22.56:2.6": "viññāṇaṁ abbhaññāsiṁ, viññāṇasamudayaṁ abbhaññāsiṁ, viññāṇanirodhaṁ abbhaññāsiṁ, viññāṇanirodhagāminiṁ paṭipadaṁ 